  "The producer config's <code>cloth</code> block: one recipe per tag the installed reader accepts, with its fields as written. Each change is a config patch op at <code>/cloth/&lt;tag&gt;/…</code>. <strong>Show links</strong> draws the chains the tag's parts are meshed on, from the config's <code>points</code> and <code>tip</code> in rig px of the setup pose, and after an Apply the chains of the config the producer wrote. <strong>Apply</strong> runs <code>rig-parts propose --cloth --write-config</code> on the declared parts, painting and keypoints into scratch, then builds the written config (<code>rig-parts build</code> when the config declares <code>limbs</code>, else <code>rig --config</code>) and reloads it under the Environment's wind and gravity; the producer's refusals (<code>CONFIG_CLOTH_*</code>, <code>PROPOSE_CLOTH_DRAFTED</code>, <code>PROPOSE_CLOTH_PART</code>, <code>PROPOSE_WRITE_CONFIG_*</code>) are shown as printed. Review edits the recipe, never the drafted constraints. Reset returns to the inspected build and clears the pending ops.": "The producer config's <code>cloth</code> block: one recipe per tag the installed reader accepts, with its fields as written. Each change is a config patch op at <code>/cloth/&lt;tag&gt;/…</code>. <strong>Show links</strong> draws the chains the tag's parts are meshed on, from the config's <code>points</code> and <code>tip</code> in rig px of the setup pose, and after an Apply the chains of the config the producer wrote. <strong>Apply</strong> runs <code>rig-parts propose --cloth --write-config</code> on the declared parts, painting and keypoints into scratch, then builds the written config (<code>rig-parts build</code> when the config declares <code>limbs</code>, else <code>rig --config</code>) and reloads it under the Environment's wind and gravity; the producer's refusals (<code>CONFIG_CLOTH_*</code>, <code>PROPOSE_CLOTH_DRAFTED</code>, <code>PROPOSE_CLOTH_PART</code>, <code>PROPOSE_WRITE_CONFIG_*</code>) are shown as printed. Review edits the recipe, never the drafted constraints. Reset returns to the inspected build and clears the pending ops.",
